        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Egg curry serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes. Boil the eggs first and set them aside. Brown the onion base well, as it carries the gravy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lightly fry the boiled eggs in turmeric before adding them so they hold colour."
          }
        ]
      },
